  "description": "Montana is a multi-tower play structure in Baby Blue and Mango Yellow, from the Woody series of our NexLev range. A bridge links its towers, a spiral tube slide winds down from one of them, and a net climber and a climbing wall offer two ways up. A swing hangs at one end for children who want a break from climbing. The two light colours stand out clearly against a green lawn. Montana takes 40 to 45 children and covers 27'1\" x 23'6\". With a safe play area of 33'1\" x 29'6\", it suits township parks, resorts and bigger society gardens. Its listed skills are confidence building, creative thinking and problem solving. We cover the galvanised pipes, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope on Montana for 3 years. Send us your site photos and we will suggest where it goes.",
